# Normalize source files to LF in the working tree. The colocated node:test
# contract suites read worktree files directly and assert LF-sensitive
# patterns; core.autocrlf smudging to CRLF has repeatedly broken them on
# Windows checkouts. Vendored third_party sources are intentionally excluded.
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.mts text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
